WEBVTT

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:12.890
Come on!

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.020
Oh no, I'm sorry.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:27.000
That – that sister of mine, doing vocal drills this early!

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.240
I'll go tell her to cut it out!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.540
I'm sorry....

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.660
Oh man, you made her cry again.

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.170
What are you doing, Onee-chan?

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:39.140
Capisce!

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.340
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.890
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:46.140
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.670
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:52.150
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.650
I can't believe this!

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:01.010
Get dance! Come to PriPara today, and

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:07.700
Dance! The rainbow in your heart shines – an exciting neverland!

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:20.240
Just wishing for something – that won't make it come true

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:25.720
Soon you'll hear the melody of your heartbeat

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:31.100
There are things you can't lose – don't ever let them go

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:35.690
Let's start! This miraculous friendship is forever!

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:41.450
Dream of live, honest feelings are the best

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:44.780
Music that goes beyond words

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:50.290
Don't let them go; embrace your happy days right now

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:55.340
Crystal rainbow shower, a shooting star threads the sky

00:01:55.340 --> 00:02:01.300
It's your showtime, until you reach your destined stage

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:06.410
Open the closet and meet your sparkling future

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:12.390
You can even become a Divine Idol – go on and show me!

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:15.060
Smile! The parade's ready, so come and

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:22.410
Dance! The rainbow in your heart shines – an exciting neverland!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.400
Taking care of a baby is <i>hard work</i>...

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:40.060
We've got to find Jululu's real mother quickly.

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.220
Since you met her in PriPara,

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.340
she's got to belong to someone in PriPara.

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.860
I'm sure Jululu's mum is worried about her, too.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:49.020
Yeah!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.250
As soon as school's over, we'll head straight to PriPara and look for her.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.620
Hey, wait...

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:59.390
It could be someone from Paprika Academy!

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:04.470
Don't be silly, Non. You have to be a grown-up to have a baby.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.540
Not necessarily.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.970
Every idol going to PriPara is a suspect!

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.390
Even you, Onee-chan!

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:11.930
What?!

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:15.320
Don't you get older when you go to PriPara?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:17.480
Anything could happen in that place!

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.000
Oh... right.

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.830
Nicely...

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:21.660
Whoa!
Nicely...

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:21.950
Whoa!

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:25.800
Nicely obliged! Much obliged! Nicely much obliged!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:28.060
A lovely shot of the lovely popular idols

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:30.770
for the Divine Idol Grand Prix Commemorative Edition!

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.760
Can I get a nice pose from you?

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.920
Capisce!

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:39.380
Running away on this sunny day?!

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:41.050
Good morning!

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.310
This great weather keeps me running at tension max!

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.620
Relax!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.020
Morning!

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:46.140
Good morning!

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.490
Revere heaven, love people!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:52.520
Let us go forth! Another day with reverence for heaven and love for one another!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.020
An inspiring assembly of idols –
what a wonderful morning!

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:59.210
Elite idols competing in the Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.150
Much obliged! Much obliged!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.080
Perhaps a Divine Idol will be born from among this group!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:05.490
You know it! I've got your three Divine Idols right here!

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:06.590
<i>"Born"?</i>

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:08.860
You know it! I've got your three Divine Idols right here!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:09.880
Right, Leona?

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:10.110
<i>That's true – Jululu's mother could be someone from Dressing Pafé...</i>

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.110
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:14.710
Let us go forth as comrades!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.530
Good morning.

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:19.840
Morning...

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:20.890
... to you!

00:04:20.890 --> 00:04:22.240
Diligence throughout adversity!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.100
That is to say, endure all hardships while striving for scholarly excellence.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.490
Good morning!

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:29.960
<i>Maybe I can talk about this with Head Disciplinarian Minami.</i>

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:32.400
Um, Head Disciplinarian Minami...

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.170
Much obliged!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:38.060
She's as fabulous in her school uniform as in her idol apparel!

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.130
School rule article 159:

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:42.740
Students shall not interrupt the work of the Disciplinary Committee!

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.120
I'm... truly much obliged...

00:04:47.870 --> 00:04:51.950
I'm so sorry, Disciplinary Committee and Student Council President Minami.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.800
<i>Our shoulders touched just now...</i>

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.560
<i>That makes today a Minami Memorial Day.</i>

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.870
<i>And yesterday, too, because our eyes met.</i>

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.960
<i>The day before, because our eyes didn't meet...</i>

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.880
<i>And before that...</i>

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.940
What's the matter, Manaka-san?

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:07.560
Well, you see...

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.200
<i>I can't say it!</i>

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.760
<i>And anyway, there's a chance she's Jululu's mother too...</i>

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.500
Uh, good morning!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:17.650
Hm?

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:21.020
Hey, guys, wait up!

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.440
I wanted to ask you something...

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:24.990
What's the matter?

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.090
<i>Bring it up casually, indirectly...</i>

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.760
Did one of you lose a baby recently?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.310
That supposed to be Canadian humour?

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.190
Or a Parajuk-ian joke, rather?

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:43.320
You looked so serious, too!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.140
I'm in gales of laughter!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.760
<i>I guess it's not one of them...</i>

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:53.520
Besides, Lala, do you even know how babies are made?

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:56.520
Sure, the stork brings them!

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.100
Waah!

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.670
Man, you're such a kid, Lala! Actually...

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:04.520
They come from a go bowl. That's how it was with me.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.270
Really?

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:05.990
Don't be stupid.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.910
Everyone knows they come from a cabbage patch.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:10.950
Is that right?

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:13.660
They could come from a bamboo stalk!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:15.410
That's Princess Kaguya.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.050
With Momotaro, it was a peach.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.330
I know that one!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:23.440
Hey, so maybe Ajimi-sensei came from a tube of paint.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:28.010
Da Vin...ci!

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.960
Now you're just talking nonsense.

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:30.690
Yeah, okay.

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:38.060
Let's art the lesson! Nyo-ho-ho!

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:43.150
Pick a person, picture a person – draw upon
enamel art and enable your artistry-da Vinci!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:48.180
Today it's a joint class with classes
6-5 and 6-6-Utagawa Hiroshige-da Vinci!

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.050
Think of the Venus de Milo;

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.740
look at Munch and squint at Klimt.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:55.490
Draw your hearts out: let all your come ideas through-bens!

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:58.610
But since we're in class, I'm gonna Nibelungenlied-ya to be quiet!

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:04.940
Master da Vinci, does the day find you Caravaggenial?

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:06.940
Look, Michelangelo, take a look!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.900
The orange is moving in slow mo-na Lisa!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.780
Ajimi's smiling today!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:14.970
Happy as can be, psyche like the Nike of Samothrace.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:18.830
I'll do my best to draw you cute, Nao-chan!

00:07:18.830 --> 00:07:20.420
Thanks, Takahashi-kun.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:21.940
I'm going to draw the vase.

00:07:21.940 --> 00:07:23.140
capisce capisce capisce capisce

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:23.400
<i>I hope she stays quiet through the rest of class...</i>

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:26.530
<i>I hope she stays quiet through the rest of class...</i>

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.420
An infant!

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:35.960
I shall set down the moment a demon lord's child is summoned into this world!

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.450
I drew a meat bun!

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:42.620
<i>Nao, Mikan, Aroma, Ajimi-sensei...</i>

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:45.980
<i>There's nothing out of the ordinary, so I guess I can count them out.</i>

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.650
Mama!

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:49.760
She woke up!

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:51.530
What's wrong, Lala?

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.170
I thought I heard a cry.

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:56.090
Hast thou summoned a demon child?

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:58.250
It doesn't taste like a meat bun at all...

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.940
<i>Oh man, oh man, what should I do?</i>

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.130
Oh, hey, it's break time!

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:11.030
There, there, calm down.

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.640
Jululu...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.440
What <i>is</i> the commotion over there?

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.970
President Ookanda!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.270
Why, it's Manaka Lala.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.330
Just what are you doing down there?

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:32.260
Um... well...

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.010
What is it?

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.300
<i>Her breasts?</i>

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.730
<i>That's it; she's hungry!</i>

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.650
Manaka-san!

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:45.650
Wh–What is it?

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:48.340
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.250
Say, Principal Ookanda.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:57.160
Could you tell me about when Rina-chan was a baby?

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:00.120
I bet she was just the cutest!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.870
I'm so glad you took the time to ask!

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:06.500
Allow me to regale you for the next three hours!

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:10.940
Rina-chan was born in delicate health...

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.080
I did my best to give her fresh air,

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.720
and we stayed in a sanatorium in the open fields.

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:19.160
Of course, the warranty period was only six months,

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:23.730
so this was all from the goodness of my loving heart, and Rina-chan...

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:29.080
When she's quiet like this, she is adorable.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.180
Make sure you drink plenty.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.070
Sophie-sama!

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.770
Come this way-chanko!

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:40.030
Where I've marked the ring-chanko!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.320
Pushu~

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.300
Pushu-shu~

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.460
Sophie-sama, over here, over here!

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:50.420
Pushu~ Floaty-pushu~

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.170
Pat, pat.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.500
Good girl, Jululu.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.480
Good job burping.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:10.770
All tired after eating.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.200
What a little cutie.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.190
Manaka-san.

00:10:16.270 --> 00:10:18.580
Is something bothering you?

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:19.490
Wha?

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:21.470
You seem out of it today.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:24.880
If there's anything wrong, you can talk to me about it.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:26.810
Head Disciplinarian Minami!

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:29.570
<i>I knew I could count on her!</i>

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:34.240
<i>I'm sure she'll listen to me and help me out.</i>

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:35.770
Um...

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:40.270
<i>I'll say it quietly, so I don't draw anyone's attention.</i>

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:43.790
Hey...

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.160
Yes?

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:48.830
Did you maybe lose a baby recently?

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:49.950
I certainly did <i>not</i>.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.400
Pushu...

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.400
Sophie-sama!

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.850
Jewlie!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.740
She's nowhere around.

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.000
Over there...

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:07.730
That brand is...

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:16.560
Rosette Jewel!

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:34.830
An idol wearing the new brand Rosette Jewel has appeared in PriPara!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:35.870
What's going on?

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:37.200
Rosette Jewel?!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:39.010
The Divine Idol brand?

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.290
Why is she wearing it?

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.140
Wow!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.320
She looks lovely!

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.480
But how is she wearing it?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.590
She's so cool!

00:11:59.340 --> 00:12:01.700
<i>Is the mother one of these idols?</i>

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.780
<i>How can I figure out who she is?</i>

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.130
<i>I should look for someone who's worried...</i>

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:10.520
Is Jululu's mama here?

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.400
Staaare...

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:19.620
<i>It'd become a complete and total scandal if I tried that.</i>

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.360
That was close...

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:29.890
Ow!

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.870
In no way am I playing around.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.130
I am earnestly searching for Jewlie.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.760
Ow!

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:42.080
In no way am I playing around.

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:42.940
Hm?

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:52.510
Capisce!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:55.610
I suppose I was imagining things.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.730
Perhaps the Hologrammation is faulty.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:04.140
Man...

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.360
Pri-para-ding-dong!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.340
Special news bulletin.

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:12.600
As you know, the newly-arrived Rosette Jewel

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.820
is the official brand of the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:19.970
The Divine Coord is the pinnacle of all, of course;

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:24.800
however, various designs within the brand exist and can be worn freely.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:26.510
And today...

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:30.590
the first idol to wear the brand has appeared!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.220
And her name is...

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:34.940
Junon-san!

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:37.080
Junon?

00:13:38.780 --> 00:13:42.320
Junon-san will be performing her début concert momentarily!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:47.530
Scan the appropriate number of MyTickets for your coord.

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:49.580
Starting the Coord Change!

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:54.280
The crystals and butterflies set in rosettes bring an elegant feel.

00:13:54.550 --> 00:13:57.010
The large wings are enigmatic and irresistible!

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:59.770
Triangle Coolest Coord!

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:00.680
Ju!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:11.540
So she's Junon.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.740
She really has a Rosette Jewel coord.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:16.860
She radiates confidence, even though she's a newbie-kuma!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.960
What kind of performance will we see-usa?

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:20.940
Who is this Junon, anyway?

00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:23.200
She could be a Divine Idol candidate-nekon.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.290
It's a butterfly!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:25.760
Positively fascinating.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:31.030
Let's Gauguin! Good luck, van Gogh luck-Klimt, Reuvensongstress!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.820
<i>Jululu's really having fun.</i>

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:51.930
Ju!

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:55.780
Making Drama, switch on!

00:15:58.130 --> 00:15:59.280
Zoom!

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.150
Wow!

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:06.190
Ehe! Swoosh!

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:09.170
Let's go! Yeah!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:11.510
Get together and make a cooler world!

00:16:12.930 --> 00:16:14.360
Everyone join hands!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.800
Secret wonderful scope!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:22.420
Cyalume Change!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.260
How refreshing!

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:59.760
The likes are flowing – no, <i>flooding</i> in!

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:03.440
Amazing, Junon-san!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.880
She's ranked up straight to Idol of Interest!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:08.710
What?

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.920
Straight away-pri?

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:12.540
This newbie's <i>high-levelled</i>-kuma!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.120
A formidable enemy-usa!

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.420
I'm amazed as well-nekon!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:23.720
Junon is the first to wear the Rosette Jewel brand.

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:25.000
Her catchphrase is...

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.630
The "Superior Cool Butterfly"!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:29.860
That's so super!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.720
Why doth she not look this way?

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:34.290
Junon-san, would you provide a comment?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.180
Um... Junon-san?

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:50.770
Grr...

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:52.500
A frigid concert.

00:17:53.650 --> 00:17:55.240
How cool!

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:57.130
Unmelting hot ice.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:59.410
Yeah, cool!

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:01.990
The gleam of a cold-blooded jewel.

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:05.410
Super cool!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.710
Cool-Luis Barragán-da Vinci!

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:11.870
She's every bit as cool as her catchphrase!

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:15.370
How did you find it as a fellow "cool character", Shion-san?

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.380
The Antarctic continent.

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:19.970
Th–The Arctic continent!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:22.430
The Arctic isn't a continent-pri.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.220
All right, then: liquid nitrogen!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:26.060
How about that?

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:29.060
That's minus 196 degrees Celsius!

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.650
That's really cold – pri-cool!

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.570
Absolute zero.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.880
That's minus 273.15 degrees!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.530
It's colder than any temperature on Earth-pri!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:40.500
Say what?

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.740
Red beans from frozen infernal soil!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.410
A thousand-year winter.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:47.040
A solar flare sherbet.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:53.380
Saying "You think you can get anything you want by crying?" to a crying girl.

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.290
Super cool!

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.690
Superior coolness!

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:57.850
Lady Butterfly!

00:18:57.850 --> 00:18:59.150
It's the Superior Cool Butterfly!

00:18:59.150 --> 00:18:59.840
Junon!

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:00.600
I can't take it!

00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:02.480
Lady Junon!

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.730
I'll let you go for today.

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:08.700
I will allow thee to go with this!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.250
You didn't <i>do</i> anything!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:14.410
Incidentally, Junon is a part of a three-member team.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.620
That team's name is...

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.390
Triangle!

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:25.700
We'll be introducing one more member today!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.540
Twi-tw-twi-!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.600
Twinkle-kle twinkle!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:32.990
I'm Pinon-pipi!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.990
I'm a pop idol-pipi!

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.560
Pippi pappi puu!

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.340
She's a pop idol-pri?

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:42.380
It's kind of like they mixed me, Mirei and Ajimi-sensei together...

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:44.730
I'd pri-fer you don't associate me with <i>that</i>.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.460
Not at all-bertinelli!

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:50.640
but she can sure join our crew-sseau-da Vinci!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:54.240
Pinon is the princess of Planet Pinon-pipi!

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:58.020
Next I'm gonna come to Earth to play with you guys-pipi!

00:19:58.020 --> 00:20:02.370
My catchphrase is "the Friendly Princess of Planet Pinon!"-pipi!

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.570
I hope we get along-pipi!

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.380
So poppy-pipi!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.210
Pinon-chan's so cute!

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:08.540
What's she on about-pri?

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.800
She's definitely similar.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.250
She's from space!

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:14.850
I wonder what sort of idol the last member is.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:16.030
Isn't it exciting?

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:19.960
And last but not least, Triangle's manager!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.170
The manager-usa?

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:24.050
Here she is!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:26.990
Ucha!

00:20:27.010 --> 00:20:28.850
Here she is, Usacha-san!

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:29.970
Kuma!

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:31.660
It's Usacha-usa!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.520
Usacha, it's been so long-usa!

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.890
Stop-ucha!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.310
Nii-cha is a sworn foe!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:38.730
Usaa!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:43.060
Usacha graduated and became a full-fledged mascot!

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:46.300
And then became the manager of Triangle!

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:48.410
Usa...cha?

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:51.790
I really love my big brother...

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.000
Me too! I adore my little sister-usa!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.740
And it's because of the respect I have for you

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:00.200
that I have to overcome and defeat you-ucha!

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.370
Even though I love you...

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:04.330
You're the enemy-ucha!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.120
Usacha...

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:09.150
Nii-cha!

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:14.200
For now, we're no longer siblings...

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:16.200
... we're rivals-usa.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:18.660
We'll both fight our hardest!

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.150
There, there...

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.700
It's beary sad, a real shame...

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:31.070
Then, if you're no longer her big brother, maybe I can take your place-kuma...

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:32.780
I've always wanted an unbearably cute little sister!

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:33.620
Usa?

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:34.040
I've always wanted an unbearably cute little sister!

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:37.050
Usacha! Why don't you try calling me "Bro"?

00:21:37.050 --> 00:21:38.210
You're a moron-ucha.

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:38.610
Eh?

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:39.950
You're an enemy as well-ucha.

00:21:39.950 --> 00:21:41.790
"Moron"?!

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:43.080
That's it!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:44.990
We conclude with Usagi's tale of woe!

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:49.430
Everyone watching, give your all in the Divine Idol Grand Prix as well!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:53.860
Triangle issues a formal challenge to SoLaMi SMILE-pipi!

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:56.090
We're not gonna lose to you-pipi!

00:21:57.760 --> 00:22:00.420
Triangle has declared SoLaMi SMILE their rivals!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.810
What a thrilling turn of events!

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.090
Wha...wha...what?

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:06.510
Junon...

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.780
Pinon...

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:08.930
Pippi pappi puu!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.000
The Superior Cool Butterfly.

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:13.890
Triangle will attain the rank of Divine Idol!

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:16.910
Superior... Cool...

00:22:21.230 --> 00:22:24.500
Now, grab your jewel mic

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.780
It's time to be an idol!

00:22:27.780 --> 00:22:32.230
Making Drama, switch on!

00:22:32.780 --> 00:22:33.600
Let's go!

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:36.450
Pu-ri-pa-ra, pu-ri-pu-ri dancing!

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:39.500
Say it cutely: Capisce!

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:45.400
With your fancy coord and cute jewels,

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:51.070
Sing your lovely song
(Yay, yay, woo!)

00:22:51.070 --> 00:23:00.940
Isn't it exciting?
Hold on to all you have – it's a precious treasure

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:02.590
Yay! Yay! Wooo!

00:23:02.590 --> 00:23:05.340
Mi mi mi so la! (Mi mi mi so la!)

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:07.920
Re re re mi so! (Re re re mi so!)

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:13.600
So! La! Ti! Do! Sing it and get ready for

00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:16.430
Pu-ri-pa-ra, pu-ri-pu-ri dancing!

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:18.480
Say it cutely, yay!

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:22.160
Special, happy, happy, reach for it!
(Yay!)

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:25.020
Lucky, lucky, go and play your song
(Yay! Yay!)

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:29.960
Tell it with a do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do!
(Wooooooo!)

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:33.550
I've got my jewel mic
(Woo!)

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:36.430
On that heart-pounding stage
(Woo! Woo!)

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:42.670
Sing it with a do-re-mi-fa-so-la-ti-do!

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:46.340
Let's go!
Pu-ri-pa-ra, pu-ri-pu-ri dancing!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:49.980
Say it cutely: Capisce!

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:54.470
Jululu, why won't you <i>listen</i> to me?

00:23:54.470 --> 00:23:57.060
You're always naughty and causing me headaches!

00:23:57.900 --> 00:24:00.330
Jululu, I'm getting cross with you.

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:02.010
I won't look after you anymore!

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:02.920
Mama?

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:05.030
And there's no use acting all cute!

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:06.720
If you've got it, then tell me...

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:08.360
Jululu?

00:24:08.760 --> 00:24:10.040
Hey! Jululu?

00:24:10.330 --> 00:24:12.380
Where've you gotten to?

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:16.520
Next time, <i>Jululu's Great Adventure</i>.

00:24:16.520 --> 00:24:19.840
Aim to be a Divine Idol!
Let's go, PriPara!
